[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13800.55, "timestamp": "03:50:00", "text": "是的，我明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13802.79, "timestamp": "03:50:02", "text": "但我得说，我没兴趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13804.59, "timestamp": "03:50:04", "text": "在讨论中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13807.59, "timestamp": "03:50:07", "text": "各种各样的。是啊，我懒得管。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13810.389, "timestamp": "03:50:10", "text": "全部。实际上，你应该优先考虑事实。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13812.79, "timestamp": "03:50:12", "text": "太在意别人的感受了。虽然不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13815.83, "timestamp": "03:50:15", "text": "不，不，不。关键是，听着，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13817.91, "timestamp": "03:50:17", "text": "这真是一个危险的滑坡效应。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13819.75, "timestamp": "03:50:19", "text": "因为你重视事实，所以才会提出问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13821.67, "timestamp": "03:50:21", "text": "当逻辑凌驾于人们的感受之上时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13823.67, "timestamp": "03:50:23", "text": "它决定了行动方案。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13826.71, "timestamp": "03:50:26", "text": "问题是，你看，这都无关紧要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13828.71, "timestamp": "03:50:28", "text": "你不过是个十几岁的孩子，或者任何人。不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13831.11, "timestamp": "03:50:31", "text": "有人会关心这件事。好的。但是如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13833.189, "timestamp": "03:50:33", "text": "你身处一个给予的位置。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13835.67, "timestamp": "03:50:35", "text": "别人的工作，你得接手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13839.91, "timestamp": "03:50:39", "text": "影响人们感受的因素。但你也一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13842.55, "timestamp": "03:50:42", "text": "不应该只停留在情绪层面。你应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13845.91, "timestamp": "03:50:45", "text": "也要表现得专业一些。所以你"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13848.505, "timestamp": "03:50:48", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "don't second guess! everyone has a different interpretation"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13849.189, "timestamp": "03:50:49", "text": "你也要考虑事实和人们的看法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13851.91, "timestamp": "03:50:51", "text": "感受，将它们结合起来，然后看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13855.55, "timestamp": "03:50:55", "text": "它去向何方。好的？想象一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13859.349, "timestamp": "03:50:59", "text": "嗯，呃，我在那里，我在那里，我就像某种人"}]